WEBVTT

00:07.500 --> 00:08.960
<b>Summer break!</b>

00:08.960 --> 00:14.330
<b>That means I don't have to deal with that group
of delusional boys! This is so peaceful and nice.</b>

00:16.420 --> 00:17.920
<b>Tsukumo-kun</b>

00:18.460 --> 00:20.290
<b>F-finally...</b>

00:24.540 --> 00:27.330
<b>I'm so glad I kept at this a bit every day!</b>

00:27.710 --> 00:31.920
<b>Maybe I'll go for 10,000 pieces next.
But those are so expensive...</b>

00:34.380 --> 00:35.580
<b>Oh, come on.</b>

00:36.580 --> 00:37.540
<b>Hello? This is Hijiri-</b>

00:37.540 --> 00:39.830
<b>It's an emergency! Get over to the clubroom right now!</b>

00:42.000 --> 00:43.500
<b>Ow...</b>

00:43.500 --> 00:44.500
<b>Uh...?</b>

00:47.040 --> 00:49.540
<b>Tsukumo-kun</b>

00:47.040 --> 00:49.540
<b>Talking</b>

00:47.460 --> 00:49.540
<b>Huh? What's going on there?</b>

00:49.540 --> 00:53.040
<b>Oh, I see. It's one of those. You spotted one of those, didn't you?</b>

00:50.790 --> 00:52.330
<b>My summer...</b>

00:53.040 --> 00:54.420
<b>...is over.</b>

00:53.500 --> 00:56.000
<b>You know what I'm talking about. That thing! A cockro-</b>

01:11.330 --> 01:13.710
<b>That's right, I have awakened</b>

01:13.710 --> 01:16.540
<b>I posses a special power</b>

01:16.540 --> 01:18.710
<b>Before this barrier of mine</b>

01:18.710 --> 01:23.170
<b>All are powerless</b>

01:26.250 --> 01:28.960
<b>Perhaps the reincarnation of an angel or a devil</b>

01:28.960 --> 01:31.750
<b>I can see the unseen</b>

01:31.750 --> 01:33.960
<b>My right arm is throbbing</b>

01:33.960 --> 01:36.330
<b>But I can't unleash it yet</b>

01:36.460 --> 01:39.130
<b>Neither a kid nor an adult</b>

01:39.130 --> 01:41.460
<b>Bust open some philosophy piercings</b>

01:41.460 --> 01:45.290
<b>Cassis orange, fried chicken, squeeze some lemon on and go!</b>

01:45.580 --> 01:47.880
<b>(Drink, drink, drink, drink it up!)</b>

01:48.040 --> 01:50.380
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

01:50.380 --> 01:52.880
<b>Mingled in the darkness of solitude and twisted logic</b>

01:52.880 --> 01:55.460
<b>I can't find a proper remedy</b>

01:55.460 --> 01:57.830
<b>It's the destiny of those born as men</b>

01:57.830 --> 02:00.630
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

02:00.630 --> 02:03.130
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

02:03.130 --> 02:05.540
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

02:05.540 --> 02:08.000
<b>Swaying in the gap between ideals and reality</b>

02:08.000 --> 02:10.580
<b>I don't see a solution</b>

02:10.580 --> 02:13.130
<b>If it's my fate to live for the moment</b>

02:13.130 --> 02:15.750
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

02:15.920 --> 02:18.250
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

02:18.250 --> 02:20.830
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

02:26.750 --> 02:29.580
<b>Episode 5</b>

02:26.750 --> 02:29.580
<b>I'm Burdened with Great Power</b>

02:33.040 --> 02:34.750
<b>You're finally all here.</b>

02:35.170 --> 02:39.040
<b>Rei, why did you drag us here? What do you want?</b>

02:39.210 --> 02:41.790
<b>I got a job request from a certain source.</b>

02:42.710 --> 02:45.460
<b>A job for the Hero Club? What kind of case?!</b>

02:47.420 --> 02:50.540
<b>The setting is a theme park that
just opened this summer.</b>

02:51.250 --> 02:54.710
<b>I need you all to go undercover tomorrow for the day.</b>

02:56.380 --> 02:58.080
<b>"Amazing Land"?</b>

02:59.130 --> 03:02.420
<b>There's going to be a Blasto Ranger show there!</b>

03:02.880 --> 03:05.830
<b>They're doing a iLive show for kids right now, too.</b>

03:06.170 --> 03:08.040
<b>I really want to go see it!</b>

03:09.420 --> 03:13.670
<b>Apparently, a bunch of the staff at
the park collapsed one by one.</b>

03:14.460 --> 03:19.040
<b>I see. So basically, you want us
to uncover what's going on.</b>

03:21.460 --> 03:26.380
<b>Time to show off what Toga Ryushoin's
little gray cells can do.</b>

03:27.330 --> 03:29.540
<b>It's just a summer cold going around.</b>

03:29.790 --> 03:31.000
<b>What they're looking for...</b>

03:31.790 --> 03:33.080
<b>is personnel!</b>

03:35.330 --> 03:37.880
<b>Oh right, Big Sis Kaya's on the staff.</b>

03:38.210 --> 03:39.080
<b>Urk!</b>

03:39.080 --> 03:43.040
<b>Rei. Do you really think you're in
a position to order us around?</b>

03:43.250 --> 03:47.420
<b>I bet you were asked to find some part time workers.</b>

03:49.130 --> 03:52.880
<b>That's right, your sisters have
a hold on you huh, Tsukumo-kun?</b>

03:54.420 --> 03:56.540
<b>Please, everyone. Help me out.</b>

03:56.540 --> 03:59.670
<b>Or else... they're gonna kill me!</b>

04:00.210 --> 04:04.500
<b>What should I do?
The theme park does sound interesting...</b>

04:04.830 --> 04:06.540
<b>You'll get paid properly, too!</b>

04:07.130 --> 04:09.630
<b>The hourly wage is 1.5 times the standard amount!</b>

04:10.210 --> 04:12.250
<b>10,000 pieces!</b>

04:12.540 --> 04:13.500
<b>I'll do it!</b>

04:15.750 --> 04:17.500
<b>Thanks so much, everyone!</b>

04:18.210 --> 04:20.670
<b>I never knew Rei had so many great friends!</b>

04:21.210 --> 04:25.960
<b>They're not my friends.
They're merely pawns I keep around for my entertainm-</b>

04:25.960 --> 04:27.790
<b>Don't be rude to you friends!</b>

04:27.790 --> 04:29.460
<b>All right, Big Sis...</b>

04:31.420 --> 04:33.420
<b>So what should we do?</b>

04:33.670 --> 04:36.790
<b>Well, let me assign you to your posts.</b>

04:37.290 --> 04:39.920
<b>Noda-kun, you go help out the hero show.</b>

04:39.920 --> 04:40.880
<b>All right!</b>

04:41.130 --> 04:43.330
<b>Takashima-kun, you go to the Lost Child Center.</b>

04:43.330 --> 04:44.290
<b>Got it.</b>

04:44.830 --> 04:47.630
<b>Hijiri-san, you've got park patrol.</b>

04:48.040 --> 04:49.040
<b>I'll do my best.</b>

04:49.380 --> 04:52.000
<b>Futaba and Nakamura-kun will take the food area.</b>

04:52.000 --> 04:54.670
<b>What?! Why am I with him?!</b>

04:54.670 --> 04:55.790
<b>Understood.</b>

04:56.290 --> 04:58.630
<b>Rei, you're in charge of the Meow Meow Train.</b>

04:58.960 --> 05:02.790
<b>"Meow-"? Hmph. I'm stuck with the kiddies?</b>

05:03.130 --> 05:05.330
<b>Make sure you smile for the customers!</b>

05:06.000 --> 05:07.000
<b>Show me now.</b>

05:07.000 --> 05:07.670
<b>Huh?!</b>

05:09.540 --> 05:11.540
<b>L-like this...?</b>

05:11.540 --> 05:12.830
<b>That's one scary smile!</b>

05:12.830 --> 05:15.130
<b>I'll have to think of something...</b>

05:15.830 --> 05:20.630
<b>Anyway, we have help coming tomorrow,
so we just need your help today.</b>

05:21.250 --> 05:24.710
<b>All right! Hero Club, here we go!</b>

05:24.710 --> 05:25.750
<b>Yeah!</b>

05:27.790 --> 05:31.210
<b>It's time to open the Amazing Land gates!</b>

05:32.080 --> 05:34.330
<b>The Sunshine Stage is that way.</b>

05:34.500 --> 05:35.330
<b>Thank you.</b>

05:36.130 --> 05:38.130
<b>Yay! Let's get going!</b>

05:40.130 --> 05:43.460
<b>Mom, hurry, hurry!
The Blasto Rangers will start without us!</b>

05:44.380 --> 05:46.330
<b>Blasto Rangers</b>

05:44.920 --> 05:49.460
<b>"Blasto Rangers"... Wasn't Noda-kun helping out there?</b>

05:50.040 --> 05:53.670
<b>Help! Some bad guys are on a rampage!</b>

05:53.830 --> 05:57.250
<b>Mwahahaha! Planet Earth is ours!</b>

05:58.540 --> 06:02.460
<b>Come on everyone, let's yell really loud
for the Blasto Rangers!</b>

06:02.460 --> 06:03.630
<b>Ready, and...</b>

06:03.790 --> 06:06.130
<b>Blasto Rangers!</b>

06:10.170 --> 06:11.790
<b>It's the Blasto Rangers!</b>

06:12.710 --> 06:15.040
<b>Blasto Rangers to the rescue!</b>

06:17.460 --> 06:20.040
<b>Huh? The Red Ranger's really short.</b>

06:17.460 --> 06:21.210
<b>Uh, what's going on? What?</b>

06:20.210 --> 06:21.380
<b>Why?</b>

06:22.130 --> 06:25.540
<b>The forces of evil shrunk me down to this size!</b>

06:25.540 --> 06:28.130
<b>Don't make up stuff on the spot!</b>

06:28.500 --> 06:32.380
<b>But that can't dull the blade in my heart!</b>

06:32.540 --> 06:35.080
<b>Blasto Ranger... Red!</b>

06:36.210 --> 06:39.500
<b>Just as expected, Noda-kun is totally into this hero role.</b>

06:45.210 --> 06:49.540
<b>Mwahahaha! Is this all you've got?!</b>

06:49.790 --> 06:54.290
<b>I guess the five of us will have to combine
our powers for the ultimate move...</b>

06:54.290 --> 06:58.080
<b>No! Not yet! I can do better than this!</b>

06:58.080 --> 06:59.670
<b>Uh, but the script-</b>

06:59.920 --> 07:04.250
<b>This is the time for me to try that move
I've been practicing all summer!</b>

07:05.540 --> 07:06.670
<b>Um, uh?</b>

07:07.380 --> 07:12.500
<b>Ultimate Laser!</b>

07:16.290 --> 07:18.630
<b>It's not... working?!</b>

07:19.170 --> 07:20.710
<b>What's was that move?</b>

07:20.710 --> 07:21.880
<b>I dunno.</b>

07:21.880 --> 07:24.750
<b>W-wow... I guess it's a new Red Ranger move?</b>

07:24.750 --> 07:26.790
<b>I didn't know about it, either!</b>

07:25.380 --> 07:26.380
<b>Get over here, you!</b>

07:26.380 --> 07:27.460
<b>What're you doing, guys?!</b>

07:27.750 --> 07:30.210
<b>Please stop going off-script!</b>

07:30.210 --> 07:32.750
<b>Let go! I can still fight!</b>

07:32.420 --> 07:33.920
<b>He took it too far!</b>

07:36.170 --> 07:38.790
<b>This is where you can get on the Meow Meow Train.</b>

07:40.920 --> 07:44.830
<b>'Kay who's next? We're setting off soon...</b>

07:45.250 --> 07:47.000
<b>Meow!</b>

07:48.380 --> 07:51.000
<b>Damn it. Why do I have to wear this?</b>

07:51.330 --> 07:53.040
<b>I don't have to put up with this.</b>

07:53.040 --> 07:54.000
<b>Rei.</b>

07:55.380 --> 08:00.540
<b>Didn't your big sis tell you to say "meow meow" properly?</b>

08:03.540 --> 08:05.670
<b>I was just checking things out until now.</b>

08:05.670 --> 08:08.000
<b>Now it's time to get serious.</b>

08:08.540 --> 08:11.500
<b>Meow Meow Train, time to depurrt!</b>

08:11.500 --> 08:13.040
<b>Meow!</b>

08:13.040 --> 08:18.130
<b>Better pray to whatever god you believe in
that you'll get back alive...</b>

08:18.500 --> 08:20.170
<b>See mew!</b>

08:20.330 --> 08:22.080
<b>See mew!</b>

08:23.380 --> 08:25.500
<b>That's what he means by "serious"?</b>

08:28.250 --> 08:30.630
<b>This is the food area.</b>

08:31.040 --> 08:32.670
<b>Oh yeah, this is the place.</b>

08:33.920 --> 08:35.920
<b>One of them has a huge line...</b>

08:35.920 --> 08:36.750
<b>Uh?!</b>

08:37.880 --> 08:43.210
<b>Can we get a hamburger, a four-cheese pizza...
and an apple juice, please?</b>

08:43.790 --> 08:46.290
<b>Are you sure you won't regret your decision?</b>

08:46.710 --> 08:47.500
<b>Fine, then.</b>

08:47.920 --> 08:49.460
<b>I urgently summon...!</b>

08:49.460 --> 08:54.710
<b>...the descendant of the Minotaur slashed, alchemized,
and scorched by hellfire between holy flesh!</b>

08:54.710 --> 08:58.830
<b>A sacrifice covered by the rotting,
melting membrane from four yellow dragons!</b>

08:58.830 --> 09:01.420
<b>And extract squeezed from forbidden fruit!</b>

09:02.580 --> 09:06.170
<b>Stupid! Just tell me in normal words, you nuisance!</b>

09:06.630 --> 09:09.330
<b>Of course that's gonna result in a huge line!</b>

09:09.670 --> 09:11.420
<b>Hey, this is the place!</b>

09:11.420 --> 09:13.580
<b>Apparently the server's really interesting!</b>

09:15.500 --> 09:16.420
<b>Huh?</b>

09:16.420 --> 09:17.580
<b>The descendant of the Minotaur...!</b>

09:17.580 --> 09:19.040
<b>People actually like this?</b>

09:21.830 --> 09:25.460
<b>Lost Child</b>

09:21.830 --> 09:25.460
<b>Center</b>

09:22.460 --> 09:24.960
<b>The Lost Child Center... There it is.</b>

09:26.250 --> 09:30.210
<b>Excuse me, it seems like
this girl got separated from her mother.</b>

09:30.710 --> 09:33.580
<b>Oh, sure. Hold on a sec.</b>

09:37.000 --> 09:39.670
<b>This is an announcement about a lost child.</b>

09:40.170 --> 09:43.580
<b>A girl wearing a light blue tunic, white shorts, and...</b>

09:45.750 --> 09:46.830
<b>That's...!</b>

09:47.790 --> 09:50.250
<b>...a Sora-chan button badge on her hip!</b>

09:50.330 --> 09:54.380
<b>We have a precious young lady here wearing
a Sora-chan button badge!</b>

09:54.380 --> 09:57.170
<b>Please come to the Lost Child Center
if this sounds like your child!</b>

09:58.250 --> 09:59.500
<b>Mommy...</b>

10:01.670 --> 10:05.380
<b>We just called for your mom, so you'll see her real soon!</b>

10:06.080 --> 10:07.170
<b>Sora-chan!</b>

10:09.540 --> 10:10.460
<b>You sound funny.</b>

10:10.460 --> 10:12.880
<b>I do not! How rude!</b>

10:16.330 --> 10:20.630
<b>When you're stuck, just sing! You'll be smiling in no time!</b>

10:21.000 --> 10:25.500
<b>I don't know, so let's go.</b>

10:25.500 --> 10:28.670
<b>Look, it begins, this glowing season.</b>

10:28.670 --> 10:32.420
<b>Precious memories with you!</b>

10:32.420 --> 10:35.000
<b>Run through them and then</b>

10:35.000 --> 10:39.960
<b>Beyond lie the wonders of everyday life...</b>

10:36.710 --> 10:38.710
<b>Oh, apparently this kid's lost.</b>

10:38.710 --> 10:39.960
<b>Oh, right!</b>

10:42.290 --> 10:44.580
<b>Thank you so very much.</b>

10:45.080 --> 10:47.670
<b>Thanks, Sora-chan guy!</b>

10:50.500 --> 10:53.170
<b>Are you sure you wanted to give your charm away?</b>

10:54.540 --> 10:56.250
<b>These ones are for spreading the love.</b>

10:56.250 --> 10:58.830
<b>I have five more Sora-chans at home to keep.</b>

10:58.830 --> 10:59.920
<b>It's just common sense.</b>

10:59.920 --> 11:01.040
<b>I see...</b>

11:01.920 --> 11:05.290
<b>Meow Meow Train, time to depurrt!</b>

11:05.290 --> 11:06.710
<b>Meow!</b>

11:07.290 --> 11:08.000
<b>Meow...</b>

11:08.710 --> 11:10.290
<b>We're back!</b>

11:10.290 --> 11:12.040
<b>The next one's back already?!</b>

11:12.040 --> 11:13.130
<b>Again!</b>

11:13.130 --> 11:14.710
<b>Hurry, hurry!</b>

11:14.710 --> 11:17.750
<b>You kids... How many times do you have
to ride this to be happy...?</b>

11:19.080 --> 11:21.960
<b>It's a one-way ticket on the train to hell.</b>

11:22.500 --> 11:25.960
<b>Once you're on, there's no comew-ing back!</b>

11:25.960 --> 11:27.000
<b>And click!</b>

11:30.210 --> 11:31.790
<b>We're back!</b>

11:31.790 --> 11:34.500
<b>Argh! Meow!</b>

11:37.210 --> 11:40.830
<b>Those guys are the same no matter
where they are and what they're doing.</b>

11:40.830 --> 11:42.580
<b>That's amazing, in a way.</b>

11:45.670 --> 11:50.920
<b>Let's go! Just be myself, just "I"</b>

11:50.920 --> 11:55.210
<b>Yes, we want to shine in the now!</b>

11:56.830 --> 11:59.880
<b>It's the iLive show. Which means...</b>

12:01.210 --> 12:02.290
<b>I knew it!</b>

12:02.750 --> 12:06.330
<b>It's Sora-chan... Sora-chan's here!</b>

12:06.960 --> 12:10.460
<b>The next performance will be the Blasto Ranger show,
which will begin in a short while.</b>

12:10.460 --> 12:11.670
<b>Takashima-kun!</b>

12:13.420 --> 12:14.670
<b>Oh hey, Hijiri.</b>

12:14.670 --> 12:16.580
<b>What about your job, Takashima-kun?</b>

12:16.960 --> 12:19.540
<b>I got a break in time for the show.</b>

12:20.080 --> 12:21.670
<b>There's someone I want to go meet.</b>

12:22.210 --> 12:24.380
<b>Uh... Sora-chan?</b>

12:24.790 --> 12:26.960
<b>I felt our souls resonate as one!</b>

12:27.290 --> 12:29.080
<b>...W-with Sora-chan?</b>

12:31.710 --> 12:33.460
<b>There she is! Sora-chan!</b>

12:33.790 --> 12:35.790
<b>Another great crowd today, huh?</b>

12:36.210 --> 12:39.170
<b>Yeah. Let's keep this up in the afternoon.</b>

12:46.080 --> 12:47.710
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

12:49.500 --> 12:51.330
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

12:59.000 --> 13:01.330
<b>You're that guy from the Lost Child Center.</b>

13:02.040 --> 13:04.630
<b>Did Takashima-kun's dreams just get shattered?!</b>

13:05.330 --> 13:06.420
<b>Master...</b>

13:06.670 --> 13:07.630
<b>Huh?</b>

13:07.920 --> 13:09.630
<b>Please let me call you "Master"!</b>

13:09.630 --> 13:11.420
<b>What...?</b>

13:11.960 --> 13:16.040
<b>I'm amazed! Those moves... Each and every gesture
was Sora-chan without a doubt!</b>

13:16.040 --> 13:18.500
<b>You'd never manage that unless you watched
the anime hundreds of times!</b>

13:20.750 --> 13:22.250
<b>You could tell?</b>

13:22.250 --> 13:26.750
<b>Yes! Even now, you're eating Sora-chan's
favorite candy. It's perfect!</b>

13:26.750 --> 13:28.250
<b>You must love Sora-chan so much!</b>

13:29.960 --> 13:33.040
<b>I just can't help but put my soul into my work.</b>

13:33.330 --> 13:35.210
<b>You're so cool!</b>

13:38.000 --> 13:42.080
<b>I've got to go now,
but come see the afternoon show, too.</b>

13:42.290 --> 13:43.790
<b>Of course, Master!</b>

13:44.250 --> 13:46.170
<b>No, right now...</b>

13:48.080 --> 13:49.380
<b>I'm Sora-chan.</b>

13:50.000 --> 13:52.210
<b>Right! Sora-chan-san!</b>

13:52.210 --> 13:53.670
<b>What is this?</b>

13:55.580 --> 13:59.040
<b>I've gotta work hard to see the iLive show!</b>

13:59.500 --> 14:01.080
<b>You're awfully pumped up.</b>

14:01.540 --> 14:05.000
<b>You come watch too, Hijiri.
You'll regret it for sure if you don't!</b>

14:07.380 --> 14:10.250
<b>If you're that serious about it, maybe I should go.</b>

14:14.330 --> 14:16.710
<b>Blasto Rangers, to the rescue!</b>

14:19.830 --> 14:22.790
<b>Why's the enemy doing the Red Ranger pose?</b>

14:23.130 --> 14:26.170
<b>The forces of evil transformed me to look like the enemy!</b>

14:26.170 --> 14:31.040
<b>You're an evil minion now!
You were cut from the Red Ranger role!</b>

14:31.040 --> 14:35.080
<b>But that can't dull the blade in my heart!</b>

14:35.380 --> 14:37.920
<b>Blasto Ranger...Red!</b>

14:40.630 --> 14:41.960
<b>Prepare yourself, villain!</b>

14:41.960 --> 14:42.960
<b>Uh?!</b>

14:42.960 --> 14:46.380
<b>I'll blast you to the end of the cosmos!</b>

14:48.540 --> 14:49.460
<b>What? Uh...</b>

14:49.460 --> 14:51.960
<b>A-argh!</b>

14:51.960 --> 14:53.830
<b>That's Red Ranger's move!</b>

14:53.830 --> 14:55.170
